	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["79EFCD8E01384C0C"]
			description: [
				"Organic processes require a different kind of sterilization."
				""
				"Like with the Cleanroom you'll need to make some filter casings, but this time you're keeping out microbes instead of particles. You'll need &3Fusion MK II&r to get the &6Tritanium&r for them."
				""
				"Unfortunately, these filters can't be used on a Cleanroom you can enter - you would contaminate it immediately. They're used in the Sculk Vat instead."
				""
				"To run Sterile Cleanroom recipes inside regular multiblocks, you'll need a &6Sterile Cleaning Maintenance Hatch&r."
				""
				"&cNote: Sterile Cleaning Hatches do not allow for regular Cleanroom recipes, and putting a multiblock machine with one in a regular Cleanroom will not change that.&r"
			]
			id: "04EABD3D2C72D2C5"
			rewards: [{
				id: "75F9C602EE54F24E"
				item: "kubejs:moni_quarter"
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "2E25B07192462553"
					item: "gtceu:sterilizing_filter_casing"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "5A9B41BE40B77111"
					item: "gtmutils:sterile_cleaning_maintenance_hatch"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&2A Different Type of Clean"
			x: 3.75d
			y: -0.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["12E06D4D898F3E58"]
			description: [
				"&6Bacterial Sludge&r will be used in the Wetware processes. It can also replace &6Europium&r when regrowing &6crystal chips&r."
				""
				"Combining &6Biomass&r with &6Bacteria&r will grant you Bacterial Sludge."
				""
				"You will also get a bit back from growing &6Stem Cells&r later."
