		{
			dependencies: ["1AC91A3E05215569"]
			description: [
				"Use &6Uranium-238&r (or more efficiently, &6Uranium-235&r) to enrich &6Bacterial Sludge&r, and distill it to &6Mutagen&r. You can also use &6Naquadria&r to double your &6Enriched Bacterial Sludge&r yield."
				""
				"Mutagen is used in &6Sterilized Growth Medium&r production."
