		{
			dependencies: ["35D128D56DAFDFAA"]
			description: [
				"&9Sterilized Growth Medium&r is needed for &6Wetware Circuits&r."
				""
				"You'll need to mix &6Mincemeat&r, &2Calcium, Salt, Agar, and Mutagen&r in a mixer to make &9Raw Growth Medium&r, then use a &3Fluid Heater&r to sterilize it. &2This is a significantly more involved process than before.&r"
				""
				"Mincemeat comes from pulverizing any kind of animal meat. A &aFisher&r might be useful for this endeavor - especially &bThermal's&r &6Aquatic Entangler&r which can operate passively, produces only &6Fishes&r, and &eaccepts augments&r."
				""
				"Alternatively, you might be able to purify &6Rotten Flesh&r and get useful products out of it."
				""
				"&2Agar is produced from Mincemeat through multiple steps."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:sterilized_growth_medium_bucket"
