		{
			dependencies: [
				"04EABD3D2C72D2C5"
				"1CC092A2F2CD4589"
			]
			description: [
				"The &3Sculk Vat&r is a multiblock capable of growing Sculk products as well as other micro-organisms."
				""
				"Recipes run in the Vat will produce less and less output the farther the output hatch is from half full, producing the amount listed in &bEMI&r at exactly 50%% and up to 8x less as the hatch approaches completely empty or full. Note that the amount a recipe will produce is decided as soon as the recipe starts.\n&2While an optimal setup maintaining an exact 50% fill level is possible, it is not at all necessary to beat the pack and an approximate setup can still be viable all the way to the end.&r"
				""
				"The Vat can also store experience for use in growing Sculk. Do this by inserting &6XP Juice&r into a &6Sculk XP Draining Hatch&r. Every second, the Draining Hatch will deposit all XP Juice it has into the internal buffer of the Vat, and the amount of XP inside the Vat will decay by 1/64 of the amount it currently has stored."
				""
				"The amount of XP currently in the Vat can be seen in the Vat's GUI, or read out as a redstone signal using a &6Sculk XP Sensor Hatch&r."
				""
				"Some recipes require the amount of XP in the Vat to be within a specific range, shown in &bEMI&r, otherwise the recipe will regress."
			]
