		{
			dependencies: ["04EABD3D2C72D2C5"]
			description: [
				"Initially, you will need to obtain &6Bacteria&r either from &6Bio Chaff&r or &6Rotten Sludge&r. Both of these recipes must be run in a machine with a &6Sterile Cleaning Hatch&r."
				""
				"After you get a starting amount, it is highly recommended to switch to using the &3Sculk Vat&r for its speed. Just because it can grow Sculk doesn't mean it can't grow measly bacteria."
