			description: [
				"The &3Omnic Synthesizer&r…synthesizes &6Omnium&r. The Synthesizer will create one &6Omnium Nugget&r when its progress value reaches 100. Recipes run in the Synthesizer will grant exponentially more progress based on how many other unique recipes have run since that recipe.\n&9For reference, using a few dozen different ingredients gives hundreds of times better yield than using only two.&r"
				""
				"Therefore, the best way to produce &6Omnium&r is to input a variety of elements, and not just throw a ton of &6Iron&r, &6Copper&r, and &6Solidified Hydrogen&r into the machine and hope for the best."
