		{
			dependencies: ["15607184B546F5EE"]
			description: [
				"With &6Tritanium Coils&r, you now have the ability to make &6Raw Naquadah Solution&r and therefore &6Activated Naquadah Isotope Blend&r, the starting product of Naquadah Chemistry."
				""
				"The process consists of repeatedly distilling and cracking fluids. Cracking is done in &3Fusion Reactors&r, with 4 options of cracking material. Pick whichever one your base can handle best."
				""
				"Naquadah Chemistry yields large amounts of a variety of valuable resources. It will serve as your primary source of radioactive elements such as &6Neptunium&r and &6Californium&r, as well as providing quite a bit of other advanced materials such as &6Tritanium&r, &6Darmstadtium&r, and &6Neutronium&r."
				""
				"The midproducts of Naquadah Chemistry also have use in the making of Liquid &6Naquadah Fuels&r, made in the &3Naquadah Refinery&r. They can function as your primary power source for the rest of the pack, &6Antimatter Fuel&r being the other option."
			]
			icon: "kubejs:naquadah_waste"
